From 461d047072a8919edb965b6d0a157c813e77faab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:05:25 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] CLI: say the argument error once more at the end, on stderr

Above a long usage text the error line of an unknown option was missed
(drill export wrote nothing and it went unseen). Local change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 kicad/kicad_cli.cpp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/kicad/kicad_cli.cpp b/kicad/kicad_cli.cpp
index ceae354c3..a11164a81 100644
--- a/kicad/kicad_cli.cpp
+++ b/kicad/kicad_cli.cpp
@@ -496,6 +496,12 @@ int PGM_KICAD::OnPgmRun()
             printHelp( argParser );
         }
 
+        // The error once more at the end, on stderr: above a long usage it was missed, and
+        // nothing was written (ローカル修正: an unknown option of drill export went unseen)
+        if( !requestedHelp )
+            wxFprintf( stderr, "\nError: %s (nothing was done, exit code %d)\n", err.what(),
+                       CLI::EXIT_CODES::ERR_ARGS );
+
         return requestedHelp ? 0 : CLI::EXIT_CODES::ERR_ARGS;
     }
 
